/*
*	Sonic 3 & Knuckles Co-op Mod
*	coop_init.lemon  —  initialisation and game-start hooks
*
*	Co-op is switched on/off by the "CO-OP GAME" / "NORMAL GAME"
*	entries of the main menu (see coop.isActive in coop_defines).
